# Coefficient extension of the critical generic jet fields

Bundles `Coefficient.BaseChange`: for a field extension `k -> K`, coefficient extension gives injective
maps of generic jet algebras and generic jet function fields, sending raw and reciprocal generic
coordinates to the same coordinates over `K`, and restricting to algebra maps between the critical
source fields and between the critical observation fields.
